Astronomical calculations use pyswisseph (AGPL-3.0) and Swiss Ephemeris.
pyswisseph: https://github.com/astrorigin/pyswisseph
Swiss Ephemeris: https://www.astro.com/swisseph/
The generator explicitly selects the built-in Moshier ephemeris; it does not
bundle or claim to use external Swiss/JPL ephemeris data files.

The celestial data describes calculated geocentric positions and apparent
motions. The explanations linking these events to personal problems are jokes.

Character artwork and animation were generated for this project using image
generation and Higgsfield/Kling. Reference prompts are retained with source
assets during development. Locally served fonts retain their own license files.
